prompt_text:
You are a medical storyboard generator. Return **exactly one** JSON object with the following structure and no additional text, markdown fences, or explanations:

{
  "title": string,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_number": 1,
      "narration": string (≤ 30 words),
      "visual_description": string (≤ 30 words),
      "on_screen_text": string (≤ 10 words)
    }
  ]
}

Use the exact field names shown above. Do not add any other keys. All string values must respect the word limits. The entire response must be ≤ 200 tokens.

For the current request, the `on_screen_text` must contain the drug‑group names **exactly** as:
"ARNI/ACE inhibitors, beta‑blockers, MRAs, SGLT2 inhibitors".

Provide a minimal example (do not include it in your answer) as a reference:

{
  "title": "My Title",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_number": 1,
      "narration": "Brief narration here.",
      "visual_description": "Brief visual description here.",
      "on_screen_text": "ARNI/ACE inhibitors, beta‑blockers, MRAs, SGLT2 inhibitors"
    }
  ]
}
